    "Automate supported 5x5 crafting recipes and keep output storage available.",
  ],
  "quest.4270A72134950D16.title": "Automatic Advanced Table",
  "quest.47194A8027FE5716.quest_desc": [
    "The Quantum Compressor turns large quantities of materials into singularities. JEI lists the ingredient, quantity, catalyst and energy for each type. Do not assume every singularity uses the same amount.",
  ],
  "quest.47194A8027FE5716.title": "Quantum Compression",
  "quest.47F8EDE282AB01DD.quest_desc": [
